# Local planning research and generated comparison artifacts.
#
# Notes, reviews and rendered papers accumulate at the repo root faster than
# they can be curated, and none of them are inputs to the build. Ignore the
# whole class and re-admit the few documents that belong to the project.
*.md
!README.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md
!CHANGELOG.md
# Draft bug report against the fork this project was ported from. Belongs to the
# project rather than to a session, and `/docs/` is ignored, so it lives here.
!/UPSTREAM-NUMERIC-FD.md
!/planforge-py/README.md
!/tutorials/**/*.md
!/tests/assets/**/*.md
